<title>USA: SAC Technologies underwriter buys shares.</title>
<headline>SAC Technologies underwriter buys shares.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>SAC Technologies Inc said Wednesday its underwriter, Tuschner and Co Inc, has exercised its option and purchased 110,000 additional shares of common stock to cover overallotments in connection with the company's February 14 initial public offering of 1.1 million shares.</p>
<p>SAC develops and markets systems capable of identifying individuals through automated fingerprint analysis.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
